# Synesthetic Color Studio (local secrets)

Copy to `.env.local` at the **workspace root** (monorepo) or next to `package.json` for this app, depending on how you run Next:

```bash
# Server-side rewrite for BYO profile fetch (?profileId=…) when opening from Build Your Own
SYNGLYPH_API_INTERNAL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Required for “OpenAI (rules fallback)” suggestion mode
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional — default `gpt-4o-mini` (supports JSON mode used by `/api/color-studio/suggest-color`)
COLOR_STUDIO_SUGGEST_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
```

Restart `pnpm dev` / `pnpm dev --filter web-color-studio` after changing env vars.

Without `OPENAI_API_KEY`, the LLM route returns 503 and the UI falls back to the rule engine automatically.
